  "Title": "ELSA-2026-95086:  tesseract security update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "[4.1.1-11]\n- Fix incomplete CVE-2026-88051: reset 'size_used_' on validation failure\n  in 'GenericVector::read()'; check 'fontinfo_table_' and 'fontset_table_'\n  read return values in 'ReadIntTemplates'\n\n[4.1.1-10]\n- Replace ASSERT_HOST around LSTM model Load with graceful error\n  handling; fixes denial-of-service crash (exit 134) when CVE\n  validation correctly rejects a malformed LSTM traineddata file\n\n[4.1.1-9]\n- Resolves: CVE-2026-88047 CVE-2026-88048 CVE-2026-88049\n- Resolves: CVE-2026-88051 CVE-2026-88052 CVE-2026-88053",
